lers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ettvard_Needle\" title=\"Ettvard Needle\">Ettvard Needle</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> publishing house. Copies of the key are carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malek_Stones\" title=\"Malek Stones\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png/25px-Portrait_Malek_Stones.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png/38px-Portrait_Malek_Stones.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png/50px-Portrait_Malek_Stones.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malek Stones\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png/25px-Portrait_Malek_Stones.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Portrait_Malek_Stones.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malek_Stones\" title=\"Malek Stones\">Malek Stones</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Estra_Stir\" title=\"Estra Stir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png/25px-Portrait_Estra_Stir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png/38px-Portrait_Estra_Stir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png/50px-Portrait_Estra_Stir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Estra Stir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png/25px-Portrait_Estra_Stir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Portrait_Estra_Stir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Estra_Stir\" title=\"Estra Stir\